# CodeRabbit skills are vendored from coderabbitai/skills and pinned by
# `computedHash` in skills-lock.json. Running `npm run format` over them would
# rewrite the upstream content, change the pinned hash, and desync the local
# copy from its source. Format them upstream, not here.
.agents/skills/autofix/
.agents/skills/code-review/

# Generated by conventional-changelog; its own layout must not be reformatted.
CHANGELOG.md

# Machine-generated lock files; rewriting them desyncs the tooling that regenerates them.
.devcontainer/devcontainer-lock.json
skills-lock.json

# Dotenv template: prettier ships no `.env` parser, and its comments and ordering are the
# documentation for the setting each variable controls.
.env.example
